			<div class="content" id="post-content-4675677">
									

<p>Shame about the poor rating because I honestly think you have a fun idea here, this just needs some more polish. Here are some suggestions for if/when you rework this</p>
<p>1: You may want to make this slightly longer. I don't think it needs to be that much bigger but I do think there's a little room to expand.</p>
<p>2: Give us a bit more info on what SCP-5465 actually does and what the 'paraphysical capability' part means. You also may want to explain more on the gestalt part.</p>
<p>3: From my experience SCPs that try to introduce a new GOI in one go rarely work. You may want to remove the Zarathustra's Gym part and replace it with more info on SCP-5465. (I think in this case the big problem is that introducing Zarathustra's Gym introduces a new variable and plotline when the SCP is almost done).</p>
<p>4. To expand on that read through the story and cut out any extraneous details that don't add to the core narrative.</p>
<p>5. Make sure you check out the guides and get some feedback in IRC or the critique forum. I'm still noticing some SPAG (spelling and grammar) issues.</p>
<p>Anyway, good luck!</p>

							</div>

								
					
